: "comfy-core", "ver": "0.36.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeQwenImage21", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#653", "groupcolor": "#b58b2a", "color": "#432"}}, "order": 15, "widgets_values_named": {"negative_prompt": "", "prompt": "", "resolution": 1024}}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["A vertically oriented realistic cinematic photograph shows a warm late-afternoon or sunset scene inside a Paris-style café overlooking a narrow historic city street. Across the upper-left portion of the image, layered over the window area and extending toward the center-left, there is prominent overlaid white text acting like an editing label or poster caption: \"Text-to-Image: Qwen Image 2.1 T8PE Accelerated Edition\" (appearing as a single line). The typeface appears clean, rounded, bold sans-serif, arranged horizontally from left to right, colored solid white with slight transparency where it overlaps darker architectural details and faintly integrated into the scenery without appearing as physically printed paper.\n\nThe central visual focus is an apparent East Asian woman in her twenties or thirties shown from about mid-thigh upward, seated beside a large restaurant window. She has a slim build, fair to light-medium skin tone, long wavy chestnut-brown hair falling loosely over her shoulders and down her back, and delicate facial features including a softly defined nose bridge, full lips, arched brows, and subtle eye makeup with visible lashes and understated eyeliner. Her expression is calm and contemplative as she gazes outward through the window to the right, resting her chin lightly on her hand. Strong diagonal bands of sunlight fall across her forehead, cheeks, neck, sweater sleeve, forearm, and lap, creating crisp shadows that emphasize her face contours and the chunky knit texture of her clothing.\n\nShe wears a thick cream-colored cable-knit turtleneck sweater with pronounced braided patterns, raised yarn loops, ribbed cuffs, and oversized sleeves pushed casually at the wrist. Underneath, only minimal hints of inner layering are visible near the neckline. On her right ear is a decorative dangling earring made of multiple gold-toned chains with pearl-like beads, giving a refined vintage accessory accent. She leans comfortably into a bent knee beneath the table, suggesting a relaxed café pose while looking thoughtfully at the outside view.\n\nThe setting is intimate and warmly lit. Large dark metal window frames divide the image into rectangular panes on the right and partially behind her on the left. Outside the windows, classical Haussmann-style building facades fill much of the background: beige stucco walls, tall windows, wrought-iron balcony railings, cornices, dormer roofs, rooftop chimneys, and slate-gray rooflines. Through glare and atmospheric backlight, these exterior structures appear hazy, pastel tan, mauve, and soft orange rather than sharply documentary. Farther below, several small pedestrian silhouettes move along the street, rendered softly due to distance and depth-of-field blur. One person appears near the lower middle wearing a light hat, another smaller childlike silhouette stands closer to the ground level, and other walkers occupy the sidewalk and road areas in muted winter coats.\n\nOn the café counter or table immediately in front of the woman, positioned near the lower-right quadrant, there is a steaming-looking ceramic cup filled with dark coffee placed on a matching saucer. Another similar white cup sits near the extreme bottom-left/foreground edge, partially cropped and more blurred by perspective. Beside the cups, a small clear glass vase contains delicate stems with thin leaves and tiny seed heads; the plant casts fine organic shadows on the glossy tabletop. To the right of the vase lies a flat booklet, menu, sketchbook, or napkin holder with pale pages and possibly map-like markings, though no additional words can be distinctly read. Nearby is a transparent cylindrical glass container holding water, reflecting the ambient light with sparkling highlights. A dark bottle-shaped object and other reflective glassware sit farther right and are partially cut off by the frame.\n\nInside the café, the atmosphere feels aged and elegant. Dark polished wood, worn varnish, smudged reflections, scratches, and irregular stains cover the tables and window ledge. Warm amber light glows from exposed fixtures reflected in the glass near the bottom-center area, producing a chandelier-like cluster of bokeh points. Dim framed pictures or artwork hang inside the café interior toward the far left, mostly obscured by shadow and the woman’s body. Vertical curtain folds appear behind the window framing on the left-middle region, their translucent fabric forming alternating streaks of caramel, bronze, and darkness. The overall color grade is rich and painterly, dominated by burnt orange, honey-gold, cream, chocolate brown, gray-green foliage, and weathered beige stone tones.\n\nCompositionally, the woman occupies most of the vertical height, centered slightly to the right, with her gaze leading toward the sunlit street outside. The large window structure creates geometric divisions around her head, shoulder, arms, and torso. Text overlays remain confined strictly to the upper-left corner reading exactly \"Text-to-Image: Qwen Image 2.1 T8PE Accelerated Edition\", ensuring they do not obscure key narrative elements. Shallow depth of field keeps the woman's face, sweater texture, and nearby coffee service relatively sharp while turning the street, pedestrians, and rooftops into soft luminous impressions. Camera perspective suggests an eye-level interior viewpoint using a 35mm lens with moderate wide-angle coverage and dramatic side-lighting."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 29, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "fl